    "title": "Baby Name Genius by Nametrix",
    "description": "Find the right name. Baby Name Genius has thousands of boy and girl names with name details you'll find in no other app.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\u25b6 Swipe to rate. Nametrix learns your style and shows you more of what you'll like.\r\n\u25b6 Partner up. When you both love a name, it's a match!\r\n\u25b6 Detailed name info \u2014 origin, meaning, popularity graph and rank, professions, political parties, similar names, and more.\r\n\u25b6 View name lists by category, theme, and metrics. Vintage, mythology, literary, becoming popular, common among musicians \u2014 you name it!\r\n\r\nThousands of expectant moms and dads have chosen a baby name with the help of Baby Name Genius (formerly Nametrix).\r\n\r\nDownload it now, and find out why it's been praised by the New York Times, Good Morning America, SheKnows, Freakonomics, and beyond.",
